# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
# The thermostats of the control file and Brownian dynamics in a Python
# simulation (D[python-thermostats], #278) against `mdir run` of the same
# control on a GPU, in double precision in the deterministic mode: the
# dipeptide in water (1,168 particles, PME, SHAKE and SETTLE), 40 steps.
# Langevin dynamics at constant volume (no period of coupling), with
# stochastic cell rescaling, with the motion of the center of mass
# removed, and with the leapfrog integrator; a Nose-Hoover chain of 3 at
# constant volume and of 5 with stochastic cell rescaling; and Brownian
# dynamics. For each: the
# positions, the velocities, the forces, and the cell to the bit, the
# energy file and the DCD trajectory byte for byte, the fingerprint, and
# the state of the chain, in parts, from a checkpoint of `mdir run`, and
# into `mdir run --continue`. Inputs/python_thermostats.py.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_thermostats.py %S/Inputs GPU Double mdir %t cases | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: GPU Double langevin-nvt: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: GPU Double langevin-npt: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: GPU Double langevin-com: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: GPU Double nose-hoover-nvt: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: GPU Double nose-hoover-nvt: a continuation with another thermostat is refused by both front ends, and a stage begins its chain at rest
# CHECK: GPU Double nose-hoover-npt: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: GPU Double langevin-leapfrog: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: GPU Double brownian: the state, the cell, the energy file, and the trajectory of mdir run, in parts and across a checkpoint in both directions
# CHECK: thermostats GPU Double: 7 cases passed
